<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle, Friday roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle, Friday roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade slow in the Panhandle area</p>
<p>Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers $1.00 lower. Feedlots</p>
<p>reported moderate inquiry from buyers. - USDA</p>
<p>Confirmed 9,300	     Week Ago None	   Year Ago 1,000</p>
<p>Sales on 8,200 head steers and 1,000 heifers, following a</p>
<p>weekly movement of 71,200 head.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select and Choice 2-3, 1100-1250 lbs</p>
<p>67.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select and Choice 2-3, 1000-1150 lbs</p>
<p>67.00.</p>
</text>
